So God said, "Let the earth sprout <n>[tender]</n><f>[9]</f> vegetation,<f>[10]</f> plants yielding seed, and fruit trees bearing fruit according to (limited to, consistent with) their kind, whose seed is in them upon the earth"; and it was so.1
