<pb/>So to the sons of Aaron the priest they gave Hebron, the city of refuge for anyone who committed manslaughter, with its pasture lands, and Libnah with its pasture lands,r±z_<But the fields of the city and its villages they had given to Caleb the son of Jephunneh as his property.3±y‚a<They gave them <n>[the city of]</n> Kiriath-arba, <i>Arba being</i> the father of Anak (that is, Hebron) in the hill country of Judah, with its surrounding pasture lands.
