Jabez cried out to the God of Israel, saying, "Oh that You would indeed bless me and enlarge my border <n>[property]</n>, and that Your hand would be with me, and You would keep me from evil so that it does not hurt me!" And God granted his request.Ñ‚ ‚	Jabez was more honorable than his brothers; but his mother named him Jabez, saying, "Because I gave birth to him in pain."SÑ ‚Koz fathered Anub, Zobebah, and the families of Aharhel the son of Harum.6Ñg ‚The sons of Helah: Zereth, Izhar, and Ethnan.\Ñ1 ‚Naarah bore him Ahuzzam, Hepher, Temeni and Haahashtari. These were Naarah's sons.GÑ ‚Ashhur, the father of Tekoa, had two wives, Helah and Naarah. Ñ‚9 ‚Penuel was the father of Gedor, and Ezer the father of Hushah. These were the sons of Hur, the eldest of Ephrathah (Ephrath), the father of Bethlehem.{Ño ‚These were the sons of<f>[1]</f> Etam: Jezreel, Ishma, and Idbash; and the name of their sister was Hazzelelponi.Ñ‚1 ‚Reaiah the son of Shobal became the father of Jahath, and Jahath became the father of Ahumai and Lahad. These were the families of the Zorathites.GÑ		 ‚<pb/>The sons of Judah: Perez, Hezron, Carmi, Hur, and Shobal.vÑe ‚The sons of Elioenai: Hodaviah, Eliashib, Pelaiah, Akkub, Johanan, Delaiah, and Ananiâ€”seven <i>in all</i>.TÑ! ‚The sons of Neariah: Elioenai, Hizkiah, and Azrikamâ€”three <i>in all</i>.Ñ‚ ‚The sons (descendants) of Shecaniah: Shemaiah. The sons of Shemaiah: Hattush, Igal, Bariah, Neariah, and Shaphatâ€”six <i>in all</i>.Ñ‚ ‚The sons of Hananiah: Pelatiah and Jeshaiah, the sons of Rephaiah, the sons of Arnan, the sons of Obadiah, the sons of Shecaniah.YÑ+ ‚and Hashubah, Ohel, Berechiah, Hasadiah, and Jushab-hesedâ€”five <i>in all</i>.Ñ
