Cush became the father of Nimrod; he began to be a mighty one upon the earth.iÐ	M ‚	The sons of Cush: Seba, Havilah, Sabta, Raama, and Sabteca. The sons of Raamah: Sheba and Dedan.=Ð	w ‚<pb/>The sons of Ham: Cush, Mizraim, Put, and Canaan.MÐ	 ‚The sons of Javan: Elishah, Tarshish, Kittim, and<f>[2]</f> Rodanim.FÐ	 ‚The sons of Gomer: Ashkenaz,<f>[1]</f> Diphath, and Togarmah.gÐ	I ‚<pb/>The sons (descendants) of Japheth: Gomer, Magog, Madai, Javan, Tubal, Meshech, and Tiras.;Ð	s ‚Noah, <n>[and his sons]</n> Shem, Ham, and Japheth."Ð	A ‚Enoch, Methuselah, Lamech, Ð	= ‚Kenan, Mahalalel, Jared,=Ð		y ‚<pb/>Adam <n>[his genealogical line]</n>, Seth, Enosh,	Ð
