 ð<pb/><t>Do not even associate with a man given to angry outbursts; </t><t>Or go <n>[along]</n> with a hot-tempered man,</t><br/>c…? ð<t>For the LORD will plead their case </t><t>And take the life of those who rob them.</t>K…ƒ ð<pb/><t>Do not rob the poor because he is poor <n>[and defenseless]</n>, </t><t>Nor crush the afflicted <n>[by legal proceedings]</n> at the gate <n>[where the city court is held]</n>,</t><br/>…
