""<t>Its noblesâ€”there is no one there </t><t>Whom they may proclaim kingâ€” </t><t>And all its princes will be nothing.</t><br/>uƒc""<t>But the pelican and the porcupine will take possession of it; </t><t>The owl and the raven will dwell in it. </t><t>And He will stretch over it (Edom) the measuring line of desolation </t><t>And the plumb line of emptiness.</t><br/>S
