For the seller will not regain <i>and</i> return to<f>[1]</f> what he sold, even were they yet alive; for the vision <n>[of punishment]</n> regarding all the multitude <n>[of people]</n> will not be turned back, nor will any one of them sustain his life because of his sin. n‚5JThe time has come, the day has arrived. Let not the buyer rejoice nor the seller mourn, for wrath is against all their multitude <n>[of people]</n>.- m‚SJViolence has grown into a rod of wickedness; none of them (Israel) <i>will remain</i>, none of their people, none of their wealth, nor anything eminent among them. lwJ
<pb/>'Behold, the day! Behold, it is coming! Your doom has gone forth, the rod has blossomed, arrogance has sprouted.m kƒSJ	My eye will show no pity nor will I spare <n>[you]</n>. I will repay you in accordance with your ways, while your abominations are in your midst; then you will know <i>and</i> understand that it is I, the LORD, who strikes you.N jƒJNow I will soon pour out My wrath on you and spend My anger against you, and I will judge you in accordance with your ways and will repay you <n>[with punishment]</n> for all your outrageous acts. i‚)JYour doom has come to you, O inhabitant of the land; the time has come, the day is nearâ€”tumult rather than joyful shouting on the mountains.] h3JAn end is coming; the end has come! It has awakened against you. Look, it has come!< g‚qJ<pb/>"Thus says the Lord GOD, 'A disaster is coming, <n>[one so destructive and injurious, so sudden and violent, that it stands alone,]</n> a unique disaster, look it is coming!n fƒUJFor My eye will have no pity on you, nor will I spare you, but I will repay you for your evil ways, while your abominations are among you; and you will know (recognize, understand) <n>[without any doubt]</n> that I am the LORD.'A e‚{JNow the end is upon you, and I will send My anger against you and will judge you in accordance with your ways and I will bring <n>[retribution for]</n> all your abominations upon you. d‚J"Also, son of man, thus says the Lord GOD to the land of Israel, 'An end! The end is coming on the four corners of the land.? c	{J<pb/>Moreover, the word of the LORD came to me, saying,‚
