	"So My hand will be against the <n>[counterfeit]</n> prophets who see (make up) empty <i>and</i> delusive visions and who give lying prophecies. They will have no place in the <n>[secret]</n> council of My people, nor will they be recorded in the register of the house of Israel, nor will they enter into the land of Israel, that you may know <n>[without any doubt]</n> that I am the Lord GOD.6¡m‚eJ
