But the<f>[5]</f> prince of the kingdom of Persia was standing in opposition to me for twenty-one days. Then, behold, Michael, one of the chief <n>[of the celestial]</n> princes, came to help me, for I had been left there with the kings of Persia.i¬ƒKT
