‚/ê	Jesus said to him, <J>"Today salvation has come to this household, because he, too, is a</J> <n>[<f>[2]</f> spiritual]</n> <J>son of Abraham;</J>MÉƒêZaccheus stopped and said to the Lord, "See, Lord, I am <n>[now]</n> giving half of my possessions to the poor, and if I have cheated anyone out of anything, I will give back four times as much."$É‚AêWhen the people saw it, they all <i>began</i> muttering <n>[in discontent]</n>, "He has gone to be the guest of a man who is a <n>[notorious]</n> sinner."IÉ
