ˆ	Ÿêu[Ç±èY˜                                                                                ƒ<Û8†qI am speaking in <n>[familiar]</n> human terms because of your natural limitations <n>[your spiritual immaturity]</n>. For just as you presented your bodily members as slaves to impurity and to <n>[moral]</n> lawlessness, leading to further lawlessness, so now offer your members <n>[your abilities, your talents]</n> as slaves to righteousness, leading to<f>[4]</f> sanctification <n>[that is, being set apart for God's purpose]</n>.
