éÊ" 	Íˆ!û"“—Õz%\                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        DÜVƒ$For from Him <n>[all things originate]</n> and through Him <n>[all things live and exist]</n> and to Him are all things <n>[directed]</n>. To Him be glory <i>and</i> honor forever! Amen.QÜU#Or <e>who has first given to Him that it would be paid back to him</e>?WÜT'"For <e>who has known the mind of the Lord, or who has been His counselor</e>?=ÜS‚s!<pb/>Oh, the depth of the riches and wisdom and knowledge of God! How unsearchable are His judgments <i>and</i> decisions and how unfathomable <i>and</i> untraceable are His ways!uÜRc For God has imprisoned all in disobedience so that He may show mercy to all <n>[Jew and Gentile alike]</n>.ÜQwso they too have now become disobedient so that they too may one day receive mercy because of the mercy shown to you.
