<pb/><t>But I say, did Israel fail to understand <n>[that the gospel was to go also to the Gentiles]</n>? First Moses says, </t><br/><t>"<e>I will make you jealous of those who are not a nation</e> (Gentiles); </t><t><e>With a nation that lacks understanding I will make you angry</e>."</t>‚
