But the righteousness based on faith <n>[which produces a right relationship with Him]</n> says the following: "<e>Do not say in your heart, 'Who will ascend into Heaven</e>?' that is, to bring Christ down;Ü"‚1
<pb/>For Moses writes that the man who practices the righteousness which is based on law <n>[with all its intricate demands]</n> shall live by it.@Ü!‚y
